{
  "version": 2,
  "description": "Evaluation corpus for workspace-bridge. eval/run.js clones each repo at its pinned commit into eval/truth/repos/<lang>/<name> (outputs under eval/truth/out/<lang>/<name>). metrics: health = no-truth run signals (coverage, fallback, unresolved/dropped, warnings, cold/warm time, cache size) collected for every repo; dead-code = scored against eval/labels/<name>.jsonl; affected-tests = scored against independent truth (coverage-pytest via run.js, fault-injection via eval/inject-fault.js). heldOut=true repos are never used while tuning (all false for now).",
